# LeakSanitizer suppressions for third-party system libraries only. Never suppress Paralax code here.
#
# libX11/libxkbcommon allocate per-connection state during XOpenDisplay/XKB setup that they never free; GLFW
# dlcloses the libraries at glfwTerminate, so the frames are attributed to GLFW's X11 init functions.
leak:_glfwInitX11
leak:_glfwConnectX11
